      "paragraphs": [
        "Moddok Crevice Campaign Nightfall Region Kourna Type Mission outpost Party size 8 Exit(s) Bahdok CavernsThe Floodplain of Mahnkelon Images On the world map A view inside",
        "Moddok Crevice is a hidden smuggler camp at the entrance of a secret underground route connecting Kourna and Vabbi."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Getting there",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Completion of either the Pogahn Passage or Rilohn Refuge mission will bring your character here and is the only method to unlock this outpost. The gate in The Floodplain of Mahnkelon is closed until completion of either of those missions."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Exits",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Bahdok Caverns (north, by talking to Gatekeeper Kahno; completion of mission required) The Floodplain of Mahnkelon (southwest)"
      ]
    },
