      "heading": "Services",
      "level": 4,
      "paragraphs": [
        "20 Raleva (merchant) 15 Xunlai Agent (storage upgrades) 24 Xunlai Chest (storage)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Henchmen",
      "level": 5,
      "paragraphs": [
        "(all level 20)",
        "Devona (Fighter) Aidan (Archer) Kihm (Healer) Mhenlo (Healer) Eve (Blood) Odurra (Illusion) Cynn (Fire) Herta (Earth) Sogolon (Motivation) Gehraz (Holy)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Other allies",
      "level": 4,
      "paragraphs": [
        "16 Unlucky Simon (mission starter) 15 Gatekeeper Kahno 20 Hagon (mission briefing) 10 Kournan Nobles 10 Kournan Peasants 2 Kournan Children"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Notes",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Direct exploration of this outpost does not contribute towards the Cartographer title; the game considers it to be underground. Nevertheless, you can uncover nearly all of its visible surface area by carefully scraping The Floodplain of Mahnkelon. If you run to here through the desolation or hire a runner, you can start the mission after completing To Kill a Demon or No Me, No Kormir and skip Rilohn Refuge or Pogahn Passage. This will make the rest of the Nightfall campain noticably shorter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Trivia",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "If your graphics card does not meet the game's minimum requirement of 64 MB of memory, this outpost is probably as far as you can progress in Nightfall; attempts to enter other explorable areas or zones will result in an error and/or an application crash.",
        "Towns and outposts in Kourna Sunspear Sanctuary • Camp Hojanu • Dajkah Inlet • Kodonur Crossroads • Moddok Crevice • Nundu Bay • Pogahn Passage • Rilohn Refuge • Venta Cemetery • Wehhan Terraces • Yohlon Haven Missions • Explorable areas • Landmarks"
      ]
    }
