  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Moddok_Crevice\" title=\"Moddok Crevice\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Moddok_Crevice_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Moddok Crevice (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Moddok Crevice\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Moddok_Crevice.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Moddok Crevice.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/8/86/Moddok_Crevice.jpg/196px-Moddok_Crevice.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/8/86/Moddok_Crevice.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bahdok_Caverns\" title=\"Bahdok Caverns\">Bahdok Caverns</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/The_Floodplain_of_Mahnkelon\" title=\"The Floodplain of Mahnkelon\">The Floodplain of Mahnkelon</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rilohn Refuge world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg/196px-Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg/294px-Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fc/Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg/392px-Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"822\" data-file-height=\"508\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Moddok_Crevice_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Moddok Crevice inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Moddok_Crevice_inside.jpg/196px-Moddok_Crevice_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Moddok_Crevice_inside.jpg/294px-Moddok_Crevice_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f9/Moddok_Crevice_inside.jpg/392px-Moddok_Crevice_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"750\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Moddok Crevice</b> is a hidden smuggler camp at the entrance of a secret underground route connecting <a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>.\n</p>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>A smuggler's camp hidden behind the <a href=\"/wiki/Mahnkelon_Waterworks\" title=\"Mahnkelon Waterworks\">Mahnkelon Waterworks</a>, the Crevice is for those who don't want to be found, those who aren't looking, and those who just want to be left alone. Residents keep to themselves and strongly suggest that you do the same.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Completion of either the <a href=\"/wiki/Pogahn_Passage\" title=\"Pogahn Passage\">Pogahn Passage</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Rilohn_Refuge\" title=\"Rilohn Refuge\">Rilohn Refuge</a> mission will bring your character here and is the only method to unlock this outpost. The gate in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Floodplain_of_Mahnkelon\" title=\"The Floodplain of Mahnkelon\">The Floodplain of Mahnkelon</a> is closed until completion of either of those missions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bahdok_Caverns\" title=\"Bahdok Caverns\">Bahdok Caverns</a> (north, by talking to <a href=\"/wiki/Gatekeeper_Kahno\" title=\"Gatekeeper Kahno\">Gatekeeper Kahno</a>; completion of mission required)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Floodplain_of_Mahnkelon\" title=\"The Floodplain of Mahnkelon\">The Floodplain of Mahnkelon</a> (southwest)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Raleva\" title=\"Raleva\">Raleva</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchant</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Agent\" title=\"Xunlai Agent\">Xunlai Agent</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage_upgrades\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage upgrades\">storage upgrades</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henchmen\">Henchmen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Henchmen\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<dl><dd><i>(all level 20)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Devona\" title=\"Devona\">Devona</a> (Fighter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aidan\" title=\"Aidan\">Aidan</a> (Archer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Kihm\" title=\"Kihm\">Kihm</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mhenlo\" title=\"Mhenlo\">Mhenlo</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Eve\" title=\"Eve\">Eve</a> (Blood)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Odurra\" title=\"Odurra\">Odurra</a> (Illusion)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cynn\" title=\"Cynn\">Cynn</a> (Fire)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Herta\" title=\"Herta\">Herta</a> (Earth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sogolon\" title=\"Sogolon\">Sogolon</a> (Motivation)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Gehraz\" title=\"Gehraz\">Gehraz</a> (Holy)</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_allies\">Other allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Other allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 16 <a href=\"/wiki/Unlucky_Simon\" title=\"Unlucky Simon\">Unlucky Simon</a> (mission starter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Gatekeeper_Kahno\" title=\"Gatekeeper Kahno\">Gatekeeper Kahno</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Hagon\" title=\"Hagon\">Hagon</a> (mission briefing)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Kournan_Noble\" title=\"Kournan Noble\">Kournan Nobles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Kournan_Peasant\" title=\"Kournan Peasant\">Kournan Peasants</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Kournan_Child\" title=\"Kournan Child\">Kournan Children</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Direct exploration of this outpost does not contribute towards the <a href=\"/wiki/Cartographer\" title=\"Cartographer\">Cartographer</a> title; the game considers it to be underground. Nevertheless, you can uncover nearly all of its visible surface area by carefully scraping <a href=\"/wiki/The_Floodplain_of_Mahnkelon\" title=\"The Floodplain of Mahnkelon\">The Floodplain of Mahnkelon</a>.</li>\n<li>If you run to here through the desolation or hire a runner, you can start the mission after completing <a href=\"/wiki/To_Kill_a_Demon\" title=\"To Kill a Demon\">To Kill a Demon</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/No_Me,_No_Kormir\" title=\"No Me, No Kormir\">No Me, No Kormir</a> and skip <a href=\"/wiki/Rilohn_Refuge\" title=\"Rilohn Refuge\">Rilohn Refuge</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Pogahn_Passage\" title=\"Pogahn Passage\">Pogahn Passage</a>. This will make the rest of the Nightfall campain <a href=\"/wiki/Guide_to_Vabbi_tour\" title=\"Guide to Vabbi tour\">noticably shorter</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>If your graphics card does not meet the game's minimum requirement of 64 MB of memory, this outpost is probably as far as you can progress in <a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>; attempts to enter other explorable areas or zones will result in an error and/or an application crash.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kourna#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"Kourna\">Towns and outposts in Kourna</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunspear_Sanctuary\" title=\"Sunspear Sanctuary\">Sunspear Sanctuary</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Hojanu\" title=\"Camp Hojanu\">Camp Hojanu</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dajkah_Inlet_(outpost)\" title=\"Dajkah Inlet (outpost)\">Dajkah Inlet</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kodonur_Crossroads_(outpost)\" title=\"Kodonur Crossroads (outpost)\">Kodonur Crossroads</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Moddok Crevice</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nundu_Bay_(outpost)\" title=\"Nundu Bay (outpost)\">Nundu Bay</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pogahn_Passage_(outpost)\" title=\"Pogahn Passage (outpost)\">Pogahn Passage</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)\" title=\"Rilohn Refuge (outpost)\">Rilohn Refuge</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Venta_Cemetery_(outpost)\" title=\"Venta Cemetery (outpost)\">Venta Cemetery</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wehhan_Terraces\" title=\"Wehhan Terraces\">Wehhan Terraces</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yohlon_Haven\" title=\"Yohlon Haven\">Yohlon Haven</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Kourna#Missions\" title=\"Kourna\">Missions</a